## GlassCoder run artifacts - transcripts, metrics and logs are generated data.
## Anchored to the repository root: an unanchored "metrics/" matches a directory
## of that name at any depth, and silently swallowed src/GlassCoder.Core/Metrics
## - three source files the library cannot compile without.
/logs/
/runs/
/metrics/
*.jsonl.tmp

## Local secrets / machine-specific overrides
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.env
secrets.json
## Token drops, matched at any depth. Deliberately not "token.*": core.ignorecase
## is true on Windows, so that pattern would also swallow a future Token.cs.
token.txt
token.zip

## Debug scratch output from launch profiles
.debug/
